{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run the Wildest Casino \u2014 Solo or in Co-op</strong></h2>Ever dreamed of running a casino where anything can happen? From fancy VIPs to vandals starting fires, every day brings hilarious problems to solve. Build, expand, and survive the chaos \u2014 alone or with friends.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Casino Facilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/94a46558fa44d17887aeb82aabe1c9b9.poster.avif?t=1759413953\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/94a46558fa44d17887aeb82aabe1c9b9.webm?t=1759413953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/94a46558fa44d17887aeb82aabe1c9b9.mp4?t=1759413953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Pack your casino with everything from roulette and poker to flashy slots and lucky wheels. Keep guests hooked with variety and watch your profits skyrocket with every spin, shuffle, and bet. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a Lavish Casino</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/0287a3b2ae51bfbded0fa13bba83cacf.poster.avif?t=1759413953\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/0287a3b2ae51bfbded0fa13bba83cacf.webm?t=1759413953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/0287a3b2ae51bfbded0fa13bba83cacf.mp4?t=1759413953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just about gambling. Add bars, snacks, entertainment, and quirky extras to keep guests spending longer. Design every detail \u2014 from glittering halls to shady backrooms \u2014 and turn your venue into the hottest spot in town. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hilarious Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every guest is here to play nice. Deal with troublemakers \u2014 from vandals and graffiti artists to careless smokers turning slot machines into fire hazards. Every day brings unpredictable (and hilarious) new situations for you to handle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stunning Visual Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/035cbe1d742d791a8ee2e9602828688e.poster.avif?t=1759413953\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/035cbe1d742d791a8ee2e9602828688e.webm?t=1759413953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/035cbe1d742d791a8ee2e9602828688e.mp4?t=1759413953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in Unreal Engine 5, Grand Casino Simulator delivers dazzling visuals with realistic lighting, vibrant day\u2013night cycles, and lifelike details that make your casino feel truly alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Co-op for Shared Success</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/f0eb7ead03be437e576bbadbb01e99ee.poster.avif?t=1759413953\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/f0eb7ead03be437e576bbadbb01e99ee.webm?t=1759413953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/f0eb7ead03be437e576bbadbb01e99ee.mp4?t=1759413953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why run a casino alone when you can share the chaos? Jump into co-op with friends \u2014 assign roles, divide tasks, and laugh your way through fires, vandals, and demanding VIPs as you grow your empire together.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3412160?t=1759413953","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3412160?t=1759413953","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/fa74df23aa26af5f6e989a1c95d635351eb48849/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759413953","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/fa74df23aa26af5f6e989a1c95d635351eb48849/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759413953","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run the Wildest Casino \u2014 Solo or in Co-op</strong></h2>Ever dreamed of running a casino where anything can happen? From fancy VIPs to vandals starting fires, every day brings hilarious problems to solve. Build, expand, and survive the chaos \u2014 alone or with friends.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Casino Facilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as